  "Cool Emberlight before sending Taro through it.": "Kühlen Sie Emberlight ab, bevor Sie Taro hindurchschicken.",
  "Cool Emberlight first": "Cooles Emberlight zuerst",
  "Cool Picture Match": "Cooles Bildmatch",
